OL,3,GNEWSARare Sir Grayson Perry work joins
OL,4,Acentenary exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FRare early work by Sir Grayson Perry
OL,7,Fwill go on display as part of an
OL,8,Fexhibition celebrating Portsmouth's
OL,9,Fcentenary.
OL,11,FThe Extremes of English Mediocrity, was
OL,12,Fcreated by Perry in 1986, four years
OL,13,Fafter he graduated from Portsmouth
OL,14,FPolytechnic with a degree in fine art.
OL,16,FIt will be on show at the Hampshire
OL,17,Fcity's museum as part of the Portsmouth
OL,18,F100 exhibition.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
