OL,3,GNEWSARare Sir Grayson Perry work joins
OL,4,Acentenary exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe city council said it was an
OL,7,Fimportant acquisition, bringing the
OL,8,Fartist's work into its collection of
OL,9,Fstudio ceramics for the first time and
OL,10,Freflecting his connection to the city.
